# Scenic Driver Skia cross-compilation support
#
# This buildroot extension provides a sysroot for cross-compiling
# the scenic_driver_skia Rustler NIF.
#
# rust-skia handles building Skia from source, so no custom packages
# are needed here - we just use standard Buildroot packages for the
# required dependencies (Mesa, libdrm, fontconfig, etc.)

# No custom packages needed - all dependencies are standard Buildroot packages
